OL,3,GNEWSANo people or animals hurt in fire,
OL,4,Asays attraction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular family attraction in Surrey
OL,7,Fhas said no-one was injured and none of
OL,8,Fits animals were hurt in a barn fire on
OL,9,FSaturday.
OL,11,FFirefighters were called to the blaze
OL,12,Fat Chobham Adventure Farm near Woking
OL,13,Fjust after 19:40 GMT.
OL,15,FJust before midnight, the attraction
OL,16,Fsaid "luckily" all the larger animals
OL,17,Fthat usually live in the barn had been
OL,18,Fmoved earlier for the winter holidays,
OL,19,Fwhile the small animals were already in
OL,20,Ftheir winter enclosure.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
